@startuml SpeakSteps_Sequence
!theme plain
title SpeakSteps - Patient & Therapist Flow Sequence Diagram

participant Patient as patient
participant Therapist as therapist
participant "Frontend\n(Flutter)" as frontend
participant "Therapist Portal\n(Web)" as therapistPortal
participant "Firebase\nAuth" as auth
participant "Backend API" as api
participant "Cueing\nEngine" as cueing
participant "ML\nPredictor" as ml
participant "Firestore\nDB" as db

patient -> frontend: 1. Sign In
frontend -> auth: 2. Authenticate
auth -> db: 3. Verify User
db --> auth: 4. User Valid
auth --> frontend: 5. Auth Token
frontend --> patient: 6. Login Success

patient -> frontend: 7. Select Module & Exercise
frontend -> api: 8. Get Exercise Details
api -> db: 9. Query Exercise
db --> api: 10. Return Exercise Data
api --> frontend: 11. Display Exercise

patient -> frontend: 12. Attempt Question
frontend -> api: 13. Submit Response

api -> cueing: 14. Check if Cue Needed\n(response_time, attempts)
cueing -> db: 15. Get Performance History
db --> cueing: 16. Return History
cueing -> ml: 17. Request ML Prediction

ml -> ml: 18. Extract Features\n(19 features)
ml -> ml: 19. Run TFLite Model
ml --> cueing: 20. Probability Needed

cueing -> cueing: 21. Combine Rules + ML\nDecide Cue
cueing --> api: 22. Cue Decision\n(type, stage, reasoning)

api -> db: 23. Save Response\n& Decision
db --> api: 24. Saved

api --> frontend: 25. Return Cue\n(if needed)

frontend --> patient: 26. Display Cue/Feedback
note right of patient: If cue given:\n- Functional (item's use)\n- Rhyming word\n- Written initial (first letter)\n- Spelling hints\n- Sentence completion\n- Phonemic (sound)\n- Modeling (full answer)

patient -> frontend: 27. Attempt Again\n(if needed)
frontend -> api: 28. Submit Next Response
api -> db: 29. Save Score & Track Progress
db --> api: 30. Updated

api --> frontend: 31. Next Question\nor Session Complete
frontend --> patient: 32. Show Progress

patient -> frontend: 33. View Session Summary
frontend -> api: 34. Get Session Stats
api -> db: 35. Calculate Performance
db --> api: 36. Return Stats\n(accuracy, time, cues used)
api --> frontend: 37. Display Dashboard
frontend --> patient: 38. Show Results

== Therapist Management & Review ==

therapist -> therapistPortal: 39. Sign In
therapistPortal -> auth: 40. Authenticate
auth -> db: 41. Verify User (role=therapist)
db --> auth: 42. User Valid
auth --> therapistPortal: 43. Auth Token
therapistPortal --> therapist: 44. Login Success

therapist -> therapistPortal: 45. Select Patient
therapistPortal -> db: 46. Query Patient Profile & Progress
db --> therapistPortal: 47. Return Patient Data

therapist -> therapistPortal: 48. Assign/Adjust Modules
therapistPortal -> api: 49. Upsert Assignment
api -> db: 50. Save Assignment
db --> api: 51. Saved
api --> therapistPortal: 52. Confirm Assignment

therapist -> therapistPortal: 53. View Live/Recent Sessions
therapistPortal -> db: 54. Fetch Session Summaries
db --> therapistPortal: 55. Return Stats

therapist -> therapistPortal: 56. Review Cue Decisions
therapistPortal -> api: 57. Get Cue Audit Trail
api -> db: 58. Query Cue/Response History
db --> api: 59. History
api --> therapistPortal: 60. Return Audit

therapist -> therapistPortal: 61. Update Cue Parameters\n(rules thresholds)
therapistPortal -> api: 62. Save Cue Config
api -> db: 63. Persist Config
db --> api: 64. Saved
api --> cueing: 65. Reload Config

therapist -> therapistPortal: 66. Export/Share Patient Report
therapistPortal -> api: 67. Generate Report
api -> db: 68. Gather Data
db --> api: 69. Data Ready
api --> therapistPortal: 70. Report Link/PDF

opt Therapist monitoring
	db --> therapistPortal: Realtime Snapshot Update\n(session progress, cues used)
end

@enduml
